k\"><a href=\"https://benjaminkimberley.itch.io/roughandtumble/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4918799/roughandtumble\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_playpen-sans\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Rough &amp; Tumble\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NzQ2NTQ0LnBuZw==/original/MBZCRU.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Rough &amp; Tumble</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_6085590\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows and macOS</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://benjaminkimberley.itch.io/roughandtumble/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1 class=\"text-center\"></h1><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">july is here and school is dead!&nbsp;\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">the next two months will last a million years.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NjE2NjI0LmdpZg==/original/O0SPIH.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">a marble run platformer!&nbsp;transform into a golf ball, and arrange objects as a human to launch yourself to new heights!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">every object has unique quirks and use cases.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NjE2NjQ0LmdpZg==/original/Q1D9yI.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">peruse the nooks and crannies of a neon forest. Encounter trinkets and doodads of all sorts. Go wherever the wind takes you!</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NjE2NjQ5LmdpZg==/original/PrSY8I.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">track down the pieces of your old fort! your couch is lost somewhere in these woods.&nbsp;<br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">a game about everything that&#x27;s possible when you don&#x27;t have to go to school.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">\uD83C\uDF20 \uD83C\uDF20 \uD83C\uDF20</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">this is the first chapter in a two-part game. it&#x27;s available here and now as a free demo. the second chapter is underway!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">~3 hours of playtime</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-center\">by benjamin kimberley • level design by erik petersen • moral support from eric yoon</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_5178338\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"04 September 2026 @ 05:13 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 25 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div tabindex=\"0\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 2 total ratings\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\"><div content=\"5.0\" itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 100.00000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></span></div><div class=\"star_holes\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star2\"></span><